
# ---- GOLDEN FIXTURE (see golden.env / golden.json for the machine-readable manifest) ----
# resetMode=loadvm  |  reset action: QMP 'loadvm golden' (live, no reboot) -> golden-reset.sh
# fixture: Win98 SE desktop + ACTIVE/focused Notepad (banner), STEADY caret, taskbar clock HIDDEN.
# tweaks: screensaver OFF (ScreenSaveActive=0); caret blink OFF (CursorBlinkRate=-1); clock hidden;
#         DPMS/monitor-blank n/a (acpi=off + generic VGA + screensaver off -> cannot blank).
# input-reactive: Notepad keyboard (chars echo at caret, arrows move it) + mouse (move/click visible).
# golden snapshot 'golden' lives INSIDE the base qcow2 disks (win98se-kvm.qcow2 + win98se-games.qcow2).
# NEVER delete those qcow2s. qemu-streamhost.sh auto '-loadvm golden' when the snapshot exists.
